macOS 11's LibreSSL 2.8 openssl req has no -addext (checked on the Mac). Phone Remote's certificate takes its
subjectAltName and extendedKeyUsage from a config file instead, which every LibreSSL reads; the certificate is
the same (checked with LibreSSL 2.8.3: both extensions, and the PKCS#12 export).

